# AdGuard Home
# No additional environment variables required.
# Configuration is done through the web UI at http://<host-ip>:3000
#
# After initial setup, configure:
# 1. DNS Rewrite: *.home.ncronquist.com → <host-ip>
# 2. Upstream DNS: 1.1.1.1, 9.9.9.9
# 3. On UDM: Settings → Networks → DHCP Name Server → Manual → <adguard-ip>
